<title>CHINA: China Jan-Nov heavy oil output down 15.21 pct y/y.</title>
<headline>China Jan-Nov heavy oil output down 15.21 pct y/y.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>China's heavy oil output totalled 19.8071 million tonnes in the first 11 months of 1996, down 15.21 percent compared with the same period last year, the State Statistical Bureau said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Heavy oil output in November alone was 1.7381 million tonnes, the bureau said. It gave no further details.</p>
</text>
